{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_10", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_10.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MS", "names": ["MS"], "gender": "?", "first": 10, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "It is conceivable.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "And in that case\u2014", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "In that case I promise you\u2014.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Look here, in that case you may print my report\u2014every word of it.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "May I?", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Have I your word for it?", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (giving him the MS.).", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Here it is; take it with you.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "It can do no harm for you to read it through, and you can give it me back later on.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Good, good!", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "That is what I will do.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "And now goodbye, Doctor.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Goodbye, goodbye.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "You will see everything will run quite smoothly, Mr. Hovstad\u2014quite smoothly.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014we shall see.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "(Bows and goes out.)", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (opens the dining-room door and looks in).", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Katherine!", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, you are back, Petra?", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (coming in).", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I have just come from the school.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (coming in).", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Has he not been here yet?", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter?", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "No, but I have had a long talk with Hovstad.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "He is quite excited about my discovery, I find it has a much wider bearing than I at first imagined.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "And he has put his paper at my disposal if necessity should arise.", "para": 10, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think it will?", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Not for a moment.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "But at all events it makes me feel proud to know that I have the liberal-minded independent press on my side.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and just imagine\u2014I have had a visit from the Chairman of the Householders' Association!", "para": 12, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh!", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "What did he want?", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "To offer me his support too.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "They will support me in a body if it should be necessary.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Katherine\u2014do you know what I have got behind me?", "para": 14, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind you?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "No, what have you got behind you?", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The compact majority.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Really?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Is that a good thing for you Thomas?", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "I should think it was a good thing.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "(Walks up and down rubbing his hands.)", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "By Jove, it's a fine thing to feel this bond of brotherhood between oneself and one's fellow citizens!", "para": 18, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "And to be able to do so much that is good and useful, father!", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "And for one's own native town into the bargain, my child!", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "That was a ring at the bell.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "It must be he, then.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "(A knock is heard at the door.)", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Come in!", "para": 22, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (comes in from the hall).", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Good morning.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Glad to see you, Peter!", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Good morning, Peter, How are you?", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "So so, thank you.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "(To DR. STOCKMANN.)", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "I received from you yesterday, after office hours, a report dealing with the condition of the water at the Baths.", "para": 26, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you read it?", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I have,", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "And what have you to say to it?", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (with a sidelong glance).", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Come along, Petra.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "(She and PETRA go into the room on the left.)", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (after a pause).", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Was it necessary to make all these investigations behind my back?", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, because until I was absolutely certain about it\u2014", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Then you mean that you are absolutely certain now?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Surely you are convinced of that.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Is it your intention to bring this document before the Baths Committee as a sort of official communication?", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Something must be done in the matter\u2014and that quickly.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "As usual, you employ violent expressions in your report.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "You say, amongst other things, that what we offer visitors in our Baths is a permanent supply of poison.", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, can you describe it any other way, Peter?", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Just think\u2014water that is poisonous, whether you drink it or bathe in it!", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "And this we offer to the poor sick folk who come to us trustfully and pay us at an exorbitant rate to be made well again!", "para": 39, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "And your reasoning leads you to this conclusion, that we must build a sewer to draw off the alleged impurities from Molledal and must relay the water conduits.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you see any other way out of it?", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't.", "para": 41, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "I made a pretext this morning to go and see the town engineer, and, as if only half seriously, broached the subject of these proposals as a thing we might perhaps have to take under consideration some time later on.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Some time later on!", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "He smiled at what he considered to be my extravagance, naturally.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you taken the trouble to consider what your proposed alterations would cost?", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "According to the information I obtained, the expenses would probably mount up to fifteen or twenty thousand pounds.", "para": 44, "sent": 3, "present": []}]}